latform Notice / Legal Action","Resolution"]}]},{"heading":"Domain-Name Disputes","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A trademark attorney should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Domain-name conflicts"},{"text":"Cybersquatting"},{"text":"Brand impersonation"},{"text":"Domain transfer mechanisms"},{"text":"Domain dispute procedures"},{"text":"Evidence of trademark rights"},{"text":"Bad-faith registration/use"},{"text":"This is becoming increasingly important as businesses move online."}]}]},{"heading":"Digital & Technology Trademarks","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Technology businesses create new trademark challenges."},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"Mobile applications"},{"text":"AI products"},{"text":"Software brands"},{"text":"Digital platforms"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Web3"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"Digital media"}]},{"type":"p","text":"An attorney should understand the difference between:"},{"type":"h","text":"brand protection"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"and"},{"text":"protection of the underlying technology, which may involve patents, copyright, trade secrets or other IP rights."}]}]},{"heading":"AI-Era Trademark Issues","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Emerging issues include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-generated brand assets"},{"text":"AI product names"},{"text":"Similar AI brand names"},{"text":"Synthetic media"},{"text":"Deepfake impersonation"},{"text":"AI-generated logos"},{"text":"Automated trademark searching"},{"text":"Global brand monitoring"},{"text":"AI-powered counterfeiting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Assisted Trademark Search"},{"type":"flow","items":["Proposed Mark","AI-Assisted Similarity Search","Trademark Database Search","Phonetic Similarity","Visual Similarity","Conceptual Similarity","Human Legal Analysis","Clearance Opinion"]},{"type":"p","text":"AI should assist the attorney, not 